**B · Hero — hand-built scene replaced with footage**
The supplied clip already contains satellite, beam, house, horizon and stars, so
it replaces the entire SVG scene rather than sitting behind it.

1. **Loop seam fixed.** The source cut visibly at its loop point — first vs last
